d\"\n00249|   en \"Check command: `{command}`\"\n00250| coding-guidance-execution-run-command\n00251|   record_type \"coding_guidance\"\n00252|   id \"execution-run-command\"\n00253|   en \"Run command: `{command}`\"\n00254| coding-guidance-program-intro\n00255|   record_type \"coding_guidance\"\n00256|   id \"program-intro\"\n00257|   en \"Here is a minimal {language} {task} program:\"\n00258|   ru \"Вот минимальная программа на языке {language} ({task}):\"\n00259|   hi \"यहाँ {language} में एक न्यूनतम प्रोग्राम है ({task}):\"\n00260|   zh \"这是一个最小的 {language} 程序（{task}）：\"\n00261|   es \"Este es un programa mínimo en {language} ({task}):\"\n00262| coding-guidance-script-intro\n00263|   record_type \"coding_guidance\"\n00264|   id \"script-intro\"\n00265|   en \"Here is a minimal {language} script:\"\n00266| coding-guidance-request-program-range\n00267|   record_type \"coding_guidance\"\n00268|   id \"request-program-range\"\n00269|   en \"Which integer range should the program use?\"\n00270|   ru \"Какой диапазон целых чисел должна использовать программа?\"\n00271|   hi \"प्रोग्राम को पूर्णांकों की कौन-सी सीमा उपयोग करनी चाहिए?\"\n00272|   zh \"程序应使用哪个整数范围？\"\n00273|   es \"¿Qué intervalo de enteros debe usar el programa?\"\n00274| coding-guidance-request-factorial-operand\n00275|   record_type \"coding_guidance\"\n00276|   id \"request-factorial-operand\"\n00277|   en \"Which integer from 0 to 18 should the program use for factorial?\"\n00278|   ru \"Факториал какого целого числа от 0 до 18 должна вычислить программа?\"\n00279|   hi \"प्रोग्राम 0 से 18 के बीच किस पूर्णांक का फैक्टोरियल निकाले?\"\n00280|   zh \"程序应计算哪个 0 到 18 之间整数的阶乘？\"\n00281|   es \"¿Para qué entero entre 0 y 18 debe calcular el factorial el programa?\"\n00282| coding-guidance-request-reversal-operand\n00283|   record_type \"coding_guidance\"\n00284|   id \"request-reversal-operand\"\n00285|   en \"Which text should the program reverse? Put the text in quotes.\"\n00286|   ru \"Какой текст должна