oved `{old}` from `{path}` and observed the result.\\\"\\n00246|   response response-coding-text-remove-ru\\n00247|     intent coding_text_remove\\n00248|     language ru\\n00249|     text \\\"Из `{path}` удалено `{old}`, результат проверен.\\\"\\n00250|   response response-coding-text-remove-hi\\n00251|     intent coding_text_remove\\n00252|     language hi\\n00253|     text \\\"`{path}` से `{old}` हटाया और परिणाम सत्यापित किया।\\\"\\n00254|   response response-coding-text-remove-zh\\n00255|     intent coding_text_remove\\n00256|     language zh\\n00257|     text \\\"已从 `{path}` 中删除 `{old}` 并验证了结果。\\\"\\n00258|   response response-coding-text-remove-es\\n00259|     intent coding_text_remove\\n00260|     language es\\n00261|     text \\\"Se eliminó `{old}` de `{path}` y se verificó el resultado.\\\"\\n00262|   response response-line-en\\n00263|     intent line\\n00264|     language en\\n00265|     text \\\"Deleted {count} line(s) containing `{old}` from `{path}` and observed the result.\\\"\\n00266|   response response-line-ru\\n00267|     intent line\\n00268|     language ru\\n00269|     text \\\"Из `{path}` удалены строки, содержащие `{old}` ({count}), результат проверен.\\\"\\n00270|   response response-line-hi\\n00271|     intent line\\n00272|     language hi\\n00273|     text \\\"`{path}` से `{old}` वाली {count} पंक्ति(याँ) हटाईं और परिणाम सत्यापित किया।\\\"\\n00274|   response response-line-zh\\n00275|     intent line\\n00276|     language zh\\n00277|     text \\\"已从 `{path}` 中删除包含 `{old}` 的 {count} 行并验证了结果。\\\"\\n00278|   response response-line-es\\n00279|     intent line\\n00280|     language es\\n00281|     text \\\"Se eliminaron {count} línea(s) con `{old}` de `{path}` y se verificó el resultado.\\\"\\n00282|   response response-file-text-unit-en\\n00283|     intent file_text_unit\\n00284|     language en\\n00285|     text \\\"No edit I can verify reads this request against `{path}`, so nothing was changed. The request names text inside the file, not the file itself, so I did not delete it.\\\"\\n00286|   response response-file-text-unit-ru\\n00287|     intent file_text_unit\\n00288|     language ru\\n00289|     text \\\"Ни одна проверяемая правка не прочитала этот запрос для `{path}`, поэтому ничего не изменено. Запрос говорит о тексте внутри файла, а не о самом файле, поэтому файл не удалён.\\\"\\n00290|   response response-file-text-unit-hi\\n00291|     intent file_text_unit\\n00292|     language hi\\n00293|     text \\\"`{path}` के लिए इस अनुरोध को कोई सत्यापन-योग्य संपादन नहीं पढ़ सका, इसलिए कुछ नहीं बदला गया। अनुरोध फ़ाइल के भीतर के पाठ के बारे में है, फ़ाइल के बारे में नहीं, इसलिए फ़ाइल नहीं हटाई गई।\\\"\\n00294|   response response-file-text-unit-zh\\n00295|     intent file_text_unit\\n00296|     language zh\\n00297|     text \\\"没有可验证的编辑能针对 `{path}` 读懂这个请求，因此未做任何更改。请求说的是文件中的文本，而不是文件本身，所以没有删除该文件。\\\"\\n00298|   response response-file-text-unit-es\\n00299|     intent file_text_unit\\n00300|     language es\\n00301|     text \\\"Ninguna edición verificable interpreta esta solicitud sobre `{path}`, así que no se cambió nada. La solicitud nombra texto dentro del archivo, no el archivo, así que no lo eliminé.\\\"\\n00302|   response response-test-expectation-missing-en\\n00303|     intent test_expectation_missing\\n00304|     language en\\n00305|     text \\\"What should the test in `{path}` check: which call, and what result? The request states no expected result, so nothing was written or run. Say what the function should return for which inputs.\\\"\\n00306|   response response-test-expectation-missing-ru\\n00307|     intent test_expectation_missing\\n00308|     language ru\\n00309|     text \\\"Что должен проверять тест в `{path}`: какой вызов и какой результат? В запросе не указан ожидаемый результат, поэтому ничего не записано и не запущено. Укажите, что функция должна вернуть и для каких входных данных.\\\"\\n00310|   response response-test-expectation-missing-hi\\n00311|     intent test_expectation_missing